%%{init: {"theme":"base","themeVariables":{"fontFamily":"Inter, Arial","primaryTextColor":"#F8FAFC","lineColor":"#94A3B8","textColor":"#F8FAFC","background":"#0F172A"},"flowchart":{"htmlLabels":true,"curve":"basis","nodeSpacing":70,"rankSpacing":90}}}%%
flowchart LR
    IN["📄 Input Documents"]:::input
    M["$match<br/>Filter documents"]:::match
    G["$group<br/>Group + calculate"]:::group
    C["$sum / $avg<br/>$max / $min"]:::calc
    N["Next Stage<br/>Optional $match / $sort / $skip / $limit"]:::next
    OUT["📊 Final Result"]:::output

    IN --> M --> G --> C --> N --> OUT
    M -. "stage output becomes next stage input" .-> G
    G -. "stage output" .-> N

    classDef input fill:#64748B,stroke:#475569,color:#FFFFFF,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef match fill:#2563EB,stroke:#1D4ED8,color:#FFFFFF,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef group fill:#7C3AED,stroke:#5B21B6,color:#FFFFFF,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef calc fill:#EA580C,stroke:#C2410C,color:#FFFFFF,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef next fill:#DB2777,stroke:#9D174D,color:#FFFFFF,stroke-width:2px;
    classDef output fill:#16A34A,stroke:#15803D,color:#FFFFFF,stroke-width:3px;
